            {
              "content": "=Research this company:\n{{ $json.company }}\n\n\nProvide:\n\n- Company size\n- Funding stage\n- Growth prospects\n- Remote culture\n- Product maturity\n\nReturn JSON only\n{\n  \"company\": \"LiveKit\",\n  \"company_size\": \"20-50\",\n  \"funding\": \"Series A\",\n  \"growth_prospects\": \"High\",\n\n  \"career_alignment_score\": 92,\n  \"market_opportunity_score\": 88,\n  \"salary_score\": 85,\n  \"risk_score\": 30,\n\n  \"apply_now\": true,\n  \"priority\": \"High\",\n\n  \"why_apply\": [\n    \"...\",\n    \"...\",\n    \"...\"\n  ],\n\n  \"why_not_apply\": [\n    \"...\",\n    \"...\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\n\n\n# Scoring Rules\n\n# Career Alignment (0-100)\n\nHow well role matches:\n\nEnterprise SaaS\nAI Products\nProduct Management\nPlatform Products\nWorkflow Automation\nTechnical PM work\nMarket Opportunity (0-100)\n\n# Market Opportunity (0-100) Consider:\n\nAI exposure\nStartup growth\nFunding\nProduct category\nFuture demand\nSalary Score (0-100)\n\n# Salary Score (0-100) Based on:\n\n100 = Significant increase\n80 = Similar pay\n50 = Slight reduction\n20 = Major reduction\nRisk Score (0-100)\n\n# Risk Score (0-100) Higher risk:\n\nTiny startup\nUnclear funding\nWeak PM culture\nNiche market"
            }
          ]
